{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed by a middle school student in less than one month. It has no storyline and might be quite boring\u2014it might not even qualify as a proper game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: In the game, players take on the role of a hunter who hunts zombies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: In this game, there is no one truly reliable; the only thing you can fully trust is the gun in your hand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: Zombies will rush at you from all directions\u2014will you flee or take the initiative to attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The game offers a wide array of weapons for players to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: You will hunt by lakesides and in dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The game provides guidance, so you will always know what to do next</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The soundtrack will deliver an immersive experience for players</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Development Costs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: Excluding time and labor costs, it was approximately $700.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Honest Thoughts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The game will undoubtedly have many bugs and shortcomings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The game was built entirely from scratch, without using any templates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: Finally, thank you very much for playing. I will accept all criticism and suggestions, and I also hope you\u2019ll be gentle with the harsh comments (QAQ).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishing you a pleasant experience!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045860?t=1760096508","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045860?t=1760096508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045860/69ff870cb743a016de911a67f8406dcb52b4e185/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760096508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045860/69ff870cb743a016de911a67f8406dcb52b4e185/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760096508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages or may not be appropriate for viewing during work: frequent violence or gore, and general adult content."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed by a middle school student in less than one month. It has no storyline and might be quite boring\u2014it might not even qualify as a proper game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: In the game, players take on the role of a hunter who hunts zombies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: In this game, there is no one truly reliable; the only thing you can fully trust is the gun in your hand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: Zombies will rush at you from all directions\u2014will you flee or take the initiative to attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The game offers a wide array of weapons for players to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: You will hunt by lakesides and in dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The game provides guidance, so you will always know what to do next</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The soundtrack will deliver an immersive experience for players</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Development Costs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: Excluding time and labor costs, it was approximately $700.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Honest Thoughts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The game will undoubtedly have many bugs and shortcomings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: The game was built entirely from scratch, without using any templates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: Finally, thank you very much for playing. I will accept all criticism and suggestions, and I also hope you\u2019ll be gentle with the harsh comments (QAQ).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishing you a pleasant experience!</p>","developers":["\u8fb0\u6781\u9f99\u5578"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045860/4b91f259dcac06f59fd97a4665bc3e5ae651c85d/header.jpg?t=1760096508","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045860/152380493/d08ae242241874985e78b6d4353ae5150f406dbb/1758427707/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758943415","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045860/152380493/d08ae242241874985e78b6d4353ae5150f406dbb/1758427707/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758943415","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045860/152380493/d08ae242241874985e78b6d4353ae5150f406dbb/1758427707/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758943415","id":257203051,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203051/movie480.mp4?t=1758943415","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203051/movie_max.mp4?t=1758943415"},"name":"\u6b66\u5668\u6f14\u5f0f","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203051/34b569f268f8e676af3587d7b190dc55803b7924/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758943415","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203051/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758943415","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2572030